  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 102.01 \"Board\" means \"board\" as defined in RSA 328-A:2, I, namely, \"the physical therapy governing board established in RSA 328-F.\"\n\nSource. #9039, eff 11-28-07; ss by #12993, eff 2-22-20 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Phy 100); ss by #14385, eff 9-23-25",
